Data notice
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The Apache-2.0 license above covers the SOURCE CODE in this repository. It does
NOT relicense the third-party datasets the application reads or bundles. Each
dataset remains under its own upstream terms. Before redistributing any derived
data, confirm the upstream license.

Datasets and their sources are listed in the README ("Data sources") and include,
among others:
  - Greater Chennai Corporation (GCC) flood inundation and storm-water drain layers
  - CPCB (Central Pollution Control Board) critically polluted area / CEPI data
  - CGWB (Central Ground Water Board) groundwater assessment data
  - AAI (Airports Authority of India) reference data
  - OpenStreetMap contributors (waterbodies, industrial land use, coastline) — ODbL
  - FEMA National Flood Hazard Layer and EPA ECHO (United States, public domain)

The GPL-3.0 geodetic/InSAR tools named in the architecture (MintPy, PyAPS, PySolid)
are NOT part of this repository and are never imported or bundled by it. They are
reserved for an isolated, out-of-process Phase B worker. See CLAUDE.md.
